
# Devin Brief: Website Modernisation Assessment & Business Modernisation Score

## Objective

We are evolving our existing website scoring system into a more comprehensive assessment that explains **why a business should replace its current website**.

The important distinction is:

> **We are still selling websites.**

This is **not** a consulting product.

This is **not** a digital transformation report.

The assessment exists purely to create evidence that naturally leads to one conclusion:

> **"A modern website is the correct investment for this business."**

The website remains the primary artifact we are selling.

---

# Core Philosophy

Our competitors begin with:

> "Would you like a new website?"

We begin with:

> "We assessed your current website."

The assessment creates evidence.

The evidence justifies the website.

The website solves the problems identified.

---

# The New Flow

```
Website URL

↓

Website Modernisation Assessment

↓

Business Modernisation Score

↓

Evidence Report

↓

